usa","d":"2018-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"R. Andrew Clyde","x":"We saw beverages really nice during the quarter, despite the price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/murphy-usa-inc-musa-q3-2018-earnings-conference-ca.aspx"},{"c":"MUSA 2018 Q3","e":"musa","d":"2018-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"R. Andrew Clyde","x":"And so, with the systematic price increases and the margin realization that comes from that, continues to be a category that grows on a gross margin dollar basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/murphy-usa-inc-musa-q3-2018-earnings-conference-ca.aspx"},{"c":"MUSA 2018 Q4","e":"musa","d":"2019-01-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"You'd see an accompanying price increase in gasoline as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/31/murphy-usa-inc-musa-q4-2018-earnings-conference-ca.aspx"},{"c":"MUSA 2018 Q4","e":"musa","d":"2019-01-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"So we'll see price increases on packaged beverages, for example, the same as in the industry.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/31/murphy-usa-inc-musa-q4-2018-earnings-conference-ca.aspx"},{"c":"MUSA 2018 Q4","e":"musa","d":"2019-01-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"These include the national rollout of our loyalty program, our retail pricing initiatives, and ongoing cost savings we expect to realize as we invest internally in improving our network.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/31/murphy-usa-inc-musa-q4-2018-earnings-conference-ca.aspx"},{"c":"MUSA 2019 Q1","e":"musa","d":"2019-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patty Kanada","x":"Do you think the recent list price increase by cigarette manufacturers had any impact on your tobacco results this quarter given your exposure to the more value-conscious customer?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"MUSA 2019 Q1","e":"musa","d":"2019-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"So in terms of the tobacco price increase, it came earlier this year than last year, so it had a -- certainly, an impact from a margin side -- there is some period there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"MUSA 2019 Q1","e":"musa","d":"2019-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"I will point out these increases we're seeing across multiple areas of the business, we consider some of these elements transitory in nature, and many of our newest cost-savings initiatives under way will not kick in until the second half of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"MUSA 2019 Q2","e":"musa","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"You know, the timing of the price increases was a little bit different this year, and so that probably didn't help as much on the unit margin standpoint.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q2-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"MUSA 2019 Q2","e":"musa","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patty Kanada","x":"Just curious if you are seeing some pushback from consumers on the Feb and now June list price increases on cig.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q2-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"MUSA 2019 Q3","e":"musa","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"And the team's gotten really smart about when their price increases, where we invest, what states, and as you probably all know, there are certain states that have state minimum prices where you think about the tactics differently in those states versus states that don't have the same regulations…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q3-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"MUSA 2019 Q3","e":"musa","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Bobby Griffin","x":"When we get into a more of a steady cadence of that business with down 6% volumes, and then, price increases, what is a normal comp look like?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q3-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"MUSA 2019 Q4","e":"musa","d":"2020-01-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"There is a lot of pressure for them to raise prices to achieve the financial performance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/31/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q4-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"MUSA 2019 Q4","e":"musa","d":"2020-01-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"I think last year and the year before, we saw in the carbonated soft drinks, some price increases there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/31/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q4-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"MUSA 2020 Q2","e":"musa","d":"2020-07-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"And I think the other thing I would say is that during this period, we also saw prices being passed through to consumers, right?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/21/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q2-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"MUSA 2020 Q2","e":"musa","d":"2020-07-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"And so I think those two fundamentals of our industry, its structure, I call it a steep supply curve where you have weaker players on one side and ultra-low players on the other side, coupled with the ability to pass-through prices which we do everyday.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/21/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q2-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"MUSA 2020 Q3","e":"musa","d":"2020-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"I think Altria just announced a price increase, and we see benefits that come from that, but we could see tax increases or other regulations that could impact that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q3-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"MUSA 2021 Q1","e":"musa","d":"2021-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"I think the other thing that the gasoline convenience industry has that most of the other industries don't is the ability to pass through higher prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"MUSA 2021 Q1","e":"musa","d":"2021-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"Certainly, if we went to $15 minimum wage, nationally, it's also probably the $30 million plus headwinds to our business for which we would expect to see over time, the industry pass-through those higher costs into higher prices to consumers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"MUSA 2021 Q1","e":"musa","d":"2021-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"Further, a review of the scalability of certain back-office functions will help streamline and efficiently automate processes, eliminating redundancies and some currently outsourced services at QuickChek.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"MUSA 2021 Q2","e":"musa","d":"2021-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"…who has larger average rosters and lower sales and volume throughput, we believe that not only will our relative cost impact be less than theirs, but we actually stand to gain to the extent they're higher relative cost continue to be passed through in the form of higher fuel prices and margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"MUSA 2021 Q2","e":"musa","d":"2021-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sam Reid","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"MUSA 2021 Q3","e":"musa","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"And as you know, margins contract when prices rise, but they really behave the same once you get to normalized but elevated levels, and it's typically higher margins because the credit card fees are higher for us and everyone else knows get passed through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q3-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"MUSA 2021 Q3","e":"musa","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"In the more elevated environment with the pass-through effects we're seeing, we're going to see more normalized run-ups and rundowns, but at a higher level.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q3-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"MUSA 2021 Q4","e":"musa","d":"2022-02-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"…said before, our low-cost model becomes further advantage during periods of wage inflation as more labor-intensive formats are forced to pass through proportionately higher cost to the fuel margin where we are well positioned to disproportionately benefit from our lower cost and higher volumes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/03/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q4-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"MUSA 2021 Q4","e":"musa","d":"2022-02-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"We're seeing the volume recover, but we're seeing a much higher residual level sustained by the pass-through pricing that we're seeing in the market and our ability to capture that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/03/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q4-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"MUSA 2022 Q1","e":"musa","d":"2022-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"…I think there's a few things we think about, I think in this quarter, we saw record absolute price increase, $0.90 a gallon, and you book in that to the Q1 of 2020 at a $1, you saw an equal and opposite effect there. And so, arguably, you would say the retail margin for us was probably…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/04/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q1-2022-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"MUSA 2022 Q1","e":"musa","d":"2022-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"Well, look, I think you're on your first observations are spot on, this was the single largest price increase we've ever seen in a quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/04/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q1-2022-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"MUSA 2022 Q1","e":"musa","d":"2022-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"Early wins from our food and beverage strategy are improving sales and contribution while streamlining labor and cost to serve both plants.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/04/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q1-2022-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"MUSA 2022 Q1","e":"musa","d":"2022-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"There's opportunities to optimize, we spent a lot of our efforts around cost management, it wasn't cost cutting, it was around optimizing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/04/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q1-2022-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"MUSA 2022 Q2","e":"musa","d":"2022-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mindy West","x":"And so that helped to contribute to industrywide margins being lower in the month of May than they otherwise would have had those price increases happened during earlier in the week or middle of the week.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/29/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q2-2022-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"MUSA 2022 Q2","e":"musa","d":"2022-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mindy West","x":"So that's kind of an overview of how the margins shook out for the quarter, just a very interesting month of May and the timing of the price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/29/murphy-usa-holding-musa-q2-2022-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"MUSA 2025 Q1","e":"musa","d":"2025-05-08","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"We can now add tariff resistance to our lexicon.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/murphy-usa-musa-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MUSA 2025 Q1","e":"musa","d":"2025-05-08","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"Between recently announced refinery closures on the West Coast, the impact of tariffs on imported crude oil and products, we can expect the oversupplied environment to cycle back to a more balanced state in due course.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/murphy-usa-musa-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MUSA 2025 Q1","e":"musa","d":"2025-05-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"…the more enduring source of higher retail margins in Q1 reflects higher breakeven economics being passed through by retailers who are experiencing more significant volume declines, greater merchandise share losses and higher operating costs, requiring higher fuel margins to maintain…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/murphy-usa-musa-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MUSA 2025 Q1","e":"musa","d":"2025-05-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Clyde","x":"Additionally, we note that lower payment fees, which are typically passed through to customers in the retail price did not appear to impact Q1 industry pricing and margins, further suggesting retailers continue to support structurally higher margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/murphy-usa-musa-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MUSA 2025 Q1","e":"musa","d":"2025-05-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mindy West","x":"…that will be a mix of revenue generation with higher dispenser uptime allowing us to sell more product, but also in terms of cost savings as well as we are uncovering opportunities, particularly with regard to self-maintenance and other things, which will help us to continue to control our costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/murphy-usa-musa-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MUSA 2025 Q3","e":"musa","d":"2025-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"R. Andrew Clyde","x":"And OpEx and G&A expenses are both expected to finish positively below the low end of our guidance due to ongoing initiatives and our previously announced staff restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/murphy-usa-musa-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MUSA 2025 Q3","e":"musa","d":"2025-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Donnie Smith","x":"On the home office side, as noted in the press release, we completed an organizational restructuring during the quarter which will help streamline our workflows and processes and eliminate technical redundancies while preserving our agile, data-driven decision capabilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/murphy-usa-musa-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MUSA 2026 Q1","e":"musa","d":"2026-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Malynda K. West","x":"You see the windfall in RINs because we report that as a separate category, but they are really just a pass-through because the RIN value is actually factored into the acquisition cost when we purchase the product.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/murphy-usa-musa-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MUSA 2026 Q1","e":"musa","d":"2026-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Malynda K. West","x":"And we are going to continue to be a preferred retailer for those manufacturers to pass through savings and attract those customers, especially as they target combustible customers where our share in cigarettes is 20%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/murphy-usa-musa-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MUSA 2026 Q2","e":"musa","d":"2026-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Mindy West","x":"And also dependent on when that price increase or decrease happens, because if it happens close to a weekend, people are already positioned where they're going to be, so you really don't see any incremental new behavior until you begin the next week.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/murphy-usa-musa-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MUSA 2026 Q2","e":"musa","d":"2026-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Mindy West","x":"But I think that the fuel margin story continues to be those marginal retailers whose costs are increasing, who are passing that on through the form of higher margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/murphy-usa-musa-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,6360,0,0,0,4925,1019],[36,1,8131,0,0,0,6878,899],[37,1,7543,0,0,0,6323,884],[38,1,7717,0,0,0,6579,799],[39,1,6810,0,0,0,5563,926],[40,1,6809,0,0,0,5666,885],[41,1,8757,0,0,0,7411,1046],[42,1,7508,0,0,0,6426,802],[43,1,8071,0,0,0,6621,1211],[44,1,9380,0,0,0,8337,781],[45,1,7550,0